            <chunk name="Object" index="6">
              <items count="3">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">3f8a6b54-9d2e-4c71-b5a8-e60d14c97a22</item>
                <item name="Lib" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">82b21a65-da8f-433c-93fb-f9814609e1d6</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Wind Predictor</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="5">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Run ONNX wind-field prediction end-to-end.
Computes SDF, building height, Zrelative, U/Uref, direction features from geometry,
assembles the 8-channel input tensor, runs ONNX inference, and outputs predicted wind speeds.
Supports legacy 1ch (U), 2ch (U + k) and new 4ch (U + k + Uroof + kroof) models.

