                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The complete annual UTCI solve as ONE item — feed to Deconstruct UTCI for statistics, comfort maps and hour selections without materializing the year as a tree. Carries the MRT probes' positions when the MRT input was a Result.</item>
